Package: RBAElisaApp
Title: RBA and ELISA Competitive Binding Assay Analysis Suite
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kristof", "Moeller",
           email = "kr.moeller@iaea.org",
           role  = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Arnold", "Molina Porras",
           role  = "aut")
  )
Description: Shiny application for radioligand binding assay (RBA) and
    enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay (ELISA) analysis. Provides 96-well
    plate layout configuration, smart file import, 4-parameter logistic
    dose-response curve fitting, QC checks, outlier detection, and
    automated HTML/DOCX report generation.
